--- !u!114 &504196335
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 504196333}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=60%>FOREST SURVIVAL - GHID RAPID:</size>\r\n\r\n<size=60%>OBIECTIVUL
    T\u0102U:</size>\r\n<size=55%>Supravie\u021Buie\u0219te o zi \u0219i o noapte
    \xEEn p\u0103dure. Pentru a reu\u0219i, trebuie s\u0103 aduni resurse esen\u021Biale.</size>\r\n\r\n<size=60%>RISCURI
    \u0218I MENTENAN\u021A\u0102:</size>\r\n<indent=5%>\r\n<b><size=55%>1. Resurse:</b>
    Adun\u0103 lemne, pietre \u0219i materiale comestibile pentru a te preg\u0103ti
    de noapte.\r\n<b><size=55%>2. Focul:</b> Focul este <color=#FF8C00>ESEN\u021AIAL</color>
    noaptea! \xCE\u021Bi ofer\u0103 c\u0103ldur\u0103 \u0219i \u021Bine animalele
    la distan\u021B\u0103.\r\n</indent>\r\n\r\n<size=60%>REGULILE JOCULUI (GAME OVER):</size>\r\n<indent=5%>\r\n<color=#FF0000><b><size=55%>\u2022
    FOAME/SETE:</b></color> Dac\u0103 bara de <b>Hran\u0103</b> sau <b>Ap\u0103</b>
    scade la <b>0</b>, ai pierdut.\r\n<color=#FF0000><b><size=55%>\u2022 PANIC\u0102:</b></color>
